    "body": "Thanks for suggesting this, @kinti! If you're working with someone who might want to implement this in a browser engine, please ask them to leave feedback here.\n\nDo you have thoughts on the precise rules for completing a string? Some inputs to consider:\n- \"http://ejemplo.com\" (how to allow more than one scheme?)\n- \" ejemplo.com \" (leading and trailing space)\n\nAlso, does setting `input.value = 'ejemplo.com'` cause it to immediately return 'https://ejemplo.com'?",
